msgstr "Pour récolter du sel dans la mare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP"
msgid "It tastes sweet."
msgstr "C'est sucré."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET"
