msgstr "Pratique pour réparer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER"
