msgstr "Ça sort des fesses d'une araignée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC"
