msgstr "Ça prolonge les roupillons quand on la lance."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT"
