#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS"
