msgid "Oh, what a shame."
msgstr "Quel dommage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER"
msgid "Eat this!"
msgstr "Et prends ça !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER"
msgid "Thank-you for the assistance, %s."
msgstr "Merci de ton aide, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "This could be useful."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE"
msgid "That looks dangerous."
msgstr "Ça a l'air dangereux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON"
msgid "Do you have any idea how much this suit cost?"
msgstr "As-tu la moindre idée du prix de ce costume ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "So I'm to traipse around looking for water, then?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Surely someone else can do these menial tasks?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON"
msgid "It's mostly water. Fibrous, sweet water."
msgstr "Essentiellement de l'eau. Fibres et eau sucrée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT"
msgid "This is one way to keep cool. And sticky."
msgstr "Une façon de rester frais. Et collant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE"
msgid "The case is cold on the melon."
msgstr "Affaire glacée pour la pastèque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED"
msgid "Grillermelon."
msgstr "Pastèque au grill."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Entirely too much watermelon."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS"
msgid "I could probably plant these."
msgstr "Je pourrais planter ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT"
msgid ""
"I'm sure its delicate appearance is just a ruse for us to let our guard "
"down."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY"
msgid "I should pluck you like the weed you are."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB"
msgid "I was right."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER"
msgid "Why would I want these to spread?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP"
msgid "Higgsbury, I think a bucket would have sufficed..."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "When did this get here?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT"
msgid "I've found the root of the problem."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER"
msgid "What is %s's motivation?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui peut bien motiver %s ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "The next fire you start will be a funeral pyre."
msgstr "Ton prochain feu sera un bûcher funéraire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Ms. %s."
msgstr "Salutations, Mme %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST"
msgid "Do you desire a heart, %s?"
msgstr "Tu veux un cœur, %s ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER"
msgid "Bloodthirsty warrior! This ends now!"
msgstr "Guerrière assoiffée de sang ! Maintenant, c'est terminé !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER"
msgid "%s has excellent command of the spirit realm."
msgstr "%s possède une excellente maîtrise du royaume des esprits."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT"
msgid "Well... it's no crown."
msgstr "Ouais... c'est pas une couronne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER"
msgid "My interest in this wax paper wanes...."
msgstr "Mon intérêt diminue pour le papier paraffiné..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER"
msgid "I know that look, %s. What are you up to?"
msgstr "Ce look me dit quelque chose, %s. Qu'est-ce que tu deviens ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Do not blow this for us, %s."
msgstr "Faut pas me laisser tomber, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC"
msgid "What a dapper fellow!"
msgstr "Ce type est d'une élégance folle !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST"
msgid "I'll have to pay in blood to bring you back, %s."
msgstr "Je vais devoir payer de mon sang pour te faire revenir, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER"
msgid "Old habits die hard... and so will you!"
msgstr "Les vieilles habitudes ont la vie dure... et tu l'auras aussi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER"
msgid "Trust only yourself, hey %s?"
msgstr "On ne fait confiance qu'à soi-même, hein %s ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Charlie."
msgstr "Désolé pour Charlie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is looking downright feral..."
msgstr "%s a vraiment l'air sauvage..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Like a moth to flame. Or a spider, maybe."
msgstr "Attiré comme un papillon par la lumière. Ou une araignée peut-être."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Mr. %s."
msgstr "Salutations, M. %s !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST"
msgid "Looks like you got squashed, %s."
msgstr "On dirait que tu t'es fait aplatir, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER"
msgid "So, %s, you're a monster after all!"
msgstr "Alors, %s, tu es un monstre en fait !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER"
msgid "This child, %s, doesn't have a mean bone in his body."
msgstr "Cet enfant, %s, n'a pas une once de méchanceté au fond de lui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL"
msgid "Reminds me of the good ol' days."
msgstr "Ça me rappelle les bons vieux jours."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION"
msgid "Disgusting."
msgstr "Dégoûtant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY"
msgid "You have no place here."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has been corrupted..."
msgstr "%s est dépravée..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't play with fire, Ms. %s."
msgstr "Ne joue pas avec le feu, Mme %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Miss %s. How are you?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST"
msgid "%s is looking a bit too much like her sister."
msgstr "%s ressemble un peu trop à sa sœur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER"
msgid "Don't think I'll hesitate, murderous fiend!"
msgstr "Ne crois pas que je vais hésiter, démon meurtrier !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is a true death defier."
msgstr "%s s'y connaît pour défier la mort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER"
msgid "It seems he's learning to bend the curse to his will."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il a coulé dans le sol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE"
msgid "Ugh, it offends my eyes."
msgstr "Pouah... ça sent mauvais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE"
msgid "Almost as powerful as it is tacky."
msgstr "Il a l'air aussi idiot que le vrai."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is giving me the creeps..."
msgstr "%s me fout les chocottes..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Stop burning things, mime."
msgstr "Arrête de brûler des trucs, mime."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Mr. %s."
msgstr "Salutations, M. %s !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST"
msgid "I could get you a heart, %s... for a price."
msgstr "Je pourrais te trouver un cœur, %s... pour un certain prix."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderous fiend! You cannot escape!"
msgstr "Démon meurtrier ! Tu ne peux pas t'échapper !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is an effective ally."
msgstr "%s est un véritable allié."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP"
msgid "How uncultured."
msgstr "Quel manque de raffinement."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER"
msgid "It's absorbent, at any rate."
msgstr "Ça absorbe l'humidité, quel que soit le taux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH"
msgid "There's something inside it."
msgstr "Il y a quelque chose à l'intérieur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WHIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WHIP"
msgid "Makes me feel like the master again."
msgstr "Avec ça, je redeviens le maître."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is withholding information..."
msgstr "%s cache des informations..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Never pinned you for the wanton destruction type."
msgstr "Je ne te croyais pas du genre à détruire sans raison."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day, Ms. %s."
msgstr "Bonjour, Mme %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST"
msgid "You know the price of revival as well as I do, %s."
msgstr "Tu connais le prix d'un retour à la vie aussi bien que moi, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER"
msgid "Do not start fights you cannot win!"
msgstr "Ne déclenche pas des bagarres que tu ne peux pas gagner !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER"
msgid "%s has excellent command of the dark arts."
msgstr "%s possède une excellente maîtrise des arts sombres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is not my ally..."
msgstr "%s n'est pas mon alliée..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "She's a firestarter. And a twisted one, at that."
msgstr "C'est une pyromane. Et une vicieuse dans le genre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Ms. %s."
msgstr "Salutations, Mme %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST"
msgid "We will require a heart to bring you back, %s."
msgstr "Il nous faudra un cœur pour te faire revenir, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderous fiend! Taste my wrath!"
msgstr "Démon meurtrier ! Tu vas connaître mon courroux !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER"
msgid "%s has bent reality to her fiery will."
msgstr "%s a soumis la réalité à sa volonté incendiaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER"
msgid "You're going off the deep end, pal."
msgstr "Tu dépasses les bornes, l'ami."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "The fire is supposed to go in the pit, Higgsbury."
msgstr "Le feu c'est pour les foyers, Higgsbury."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC"
msgid "Err, greetings, Mr. %s."
msgstr "Euh... salutations, M. %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST"
msgid "Are you certain you wish to return to this world?"
msgstr "Es-tu certain de vouloir revenir dans ce monde ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER"
msgid "Our truce ends here, murderer!"
msgstr "C'est la fin de la trêve, assassin !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is a real pal..."
msgstr "%s est un véritable ami..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC"
msgid "We are to start dredging up what lies beneath now, are we?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM"
msgid "It seems I've gotten a hold of something."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has been roughhousing like a commoner."
msgstr "%s se bagarre comme le vulgaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You were the last one I expected to start fires, %s."
msgstr "Je ne t'aurais jamais crue capable d'allumer des incendies, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Ms. %s."
msgstr "Salutations, Mme %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST"
msgid "My, you're looking spirited today, %s."
msgstr "Houlà ! Tu fais preuve de fougue aujourd'hui, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER"
msgid "You've engineered your own demise!"
msgstr "Tu as conçu ta propre perte !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER"
msgid "%s expertly uses all tools at her disposal."
msgstr "%s se sert très bien de tous les outils à sa disposition."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING"
msgid "I'm going to pretend I don't see it."
msgstr "Je vais le perdre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT"
msgid "Oh. What a pity."
msgstr "Quel dommage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC"
msgid "At least she has the sense to use gems."
msgstr "Au moins, il sait comment utiliser les gemmes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER"
msgid "I think it's losing power."
msgstr "Je crois qu'il faiblit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF"
msgid "Magic isn't so easy, is it?"
msgstr "La magie n'est pas si simple, n'est-ce pas ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING"
msgid "I'm going to pretend I don't see it."
msgstr "Je vais le perdre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT"
msgid "Oh. What a pity."
msgstr "Quel dommage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Where does she find the time to build all this."
msgstr "Où trouve-t-elle le temps de construire tout ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER"
msgid "I think it's losing power."
msgstr "Je crois qu'il faiblit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF"
msgid "See? It wasn't so great after all."
msgstr "Vous voyez ? Il n'était pas si terrible que ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING"
msgid "I'm going to pretend I don't see it."
msgstr "Je vais le perdre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT"
msgid "Oh. What a pity."
msgstr "Quel dommage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC"
msgid "I could have thought of that."
msgstr "J'aurais pu y penser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF"
msgid "It's useless out here without power."
msgstr "Complètement inutile sans alimentation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING"
msgid "I'm going to pretend I don't see it."
msgstr "Je vais le perdre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Oh. What a pity."
msgstr "Quel dommage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "Well sure, if you want to take the easy way out."
msgstr "Forcément, quand on cherche la solution de facilité."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF"
msgid "It's useless out here without power."
msgstr "Complètement inutile sans alimentation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "How disappointingly rustic."
msgstr "Désespérément rustique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Who cares?"
msgstr "Et alors ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "Not the most useful invention, is it?"
msgstr "Pas l'invention la plus utile, n'est-ce pas ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "I prefer my fuel more nightmarish."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING"
msgid "I do wish it would hurry up."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING"
msgid "What's it cooking up now?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY"
msgid "Finally!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Something about it... ah, I'm sure it's nothing."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "Stop looking at me, cookie fiend."
msgstr "Arrête de me regarder comme ça, vilain cookie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "We're celebrating freezing to death, I see."
msgstr "On célèbre le gel à pierre fendre, à ce que je vois."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "I don't even use a cane."
msgstr "Je n'utilise même pas une canne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "It is unbound from time."
msgstr "C'est libéré du temps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "How, err... traditional."
msgstr "Comme c'est... euh... traditionnel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "It's extremely rich."
msgstr "C'est extrêmement riche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "Glorified apple juice."
msgstr "Du vulgaire jus de pomme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "Such a decadent beverage."
msgstr "Quelle boisson décadente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "My... favorite... she remembered."
msgstr "Ce que... je préfère... elle s'en souvenait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Gaudy, like the rest of this shindig."
msgstr "Tapageur, comme le reste de cette fiesta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "What a thing to risk one's life for."
msgstr "Comment risquer sa vie pour ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "A volatile decoration."
msgstr "Une décoration volatile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "There's something familiar about this..."
msgstr "Ça me dit quelque chose..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "How frivolous."
msgstr "Quelle frivolité !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's a Winter's Feast miracle."
msgstr "Un miracle de fête hivernale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
