msgstr "Comme la mort, il se répand partout."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
