#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.warly.2.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.warly.2.desc"
msgid ""
"Warly could never pick a favorite, a connoisseur of great food must always "
"be expanding his palate."
