#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.walter
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.walter"
msgid ""
"*Not afraid of anything, except getting hurt \n"
"*Good with a slingshot \n"
"*Has a four-legged friend \n"
"*Allergic to bees \n"
"*Has no interest in fashion"
msgstr ""
"*N'a peur de rien, sauf d'être blessé\n"
"*Bon avec une fronde\n"
"*A un ami à quatre pattes\n"
"*Allergique aux abeilles\n"
"*N'est pas intéressé par la mode"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda"
msgid ""
"*Has excellent time management skills \n"
"*Only as old as she feels \n"
"*In a constant race against the clock"
msgstr ""
"*A une excellente compétence de gestion du temps \n"
"*Seulement âgée d'après son ressenti \n"
"*Dans une course éternelle contre la montre "

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.warly
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.warly"
msgid ""
"*Has his own line of custom portable cookware \n"
"*Can spice things up \n"
"*Has an insatiable appetite \n"
"*Only eats gourmet food"
msgstr ""
"*A ses propres ustensiles de cuisine\n"
"*Peut pimenter les choses \n"
"*A un appétit insatiable \n"
"*Ne mange que de la nourriture gastronomique"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr"
msgid ""
"*Excels in battle \n"
"*Absorbs the power of fallen foes \n"
"*Performs well under pressure \n"
"*Only eats meat"
msgstr ""
"*Excelle au combat \n"
"*Absorbe la force des ennemis tombés au combat \n"
"*Très efficace sous pression \n"
"*Ne mange que de la viande"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell"
msgid ""
"*Is dapper, but frail \n"
"*Can split his mind into pieces \n"
"*Was once the king of the world"
msgstr ""
"*Élégant, mais fragile \n"
"*Peut scinder son esprit en plusieurs morceaux \n"
"*Autrefois maître du monde"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.webber
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.webber"
msgid ""
"*Is a monster \n"
"*Can befriend spiders \n"
"*Grows a silky smooth beard"
msgstr ""
"*C'est un monstre \n"
"*Peut se lier d'amitié avec les araignées \n"
"*Il lui pousse une barbe soyeuse"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy"
msgid ""
"*Is haunted by her twin sister \n"
"*Feels comfortable in the dark \n"
"*Dabbles in Ectoherbology \n"
"*Doesn't hit very hard"
msgstr ""
"*Hantée par sa sœur jumelle \n"
"*Se sent bien dans le noir \n"
"*S'essaie à l'ectoherbologie \n"
"*Ne frappe pas très fort"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wes
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wes"
msgid ""
"*Can't talk \n"
"*Practices balloonomancy \n"
"*Is not a skilled fighter or worker \n"
"*Has trouble staying alive"
msgstr ""
"*Reste muet \n"
"*Pratique la ballonomancie \n"
"*N'est pas un très bon combattant ni constructeur \n"
"*Éprouve des difficultés à rester en vie "

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom"
msgid ""
"*Knows many things \n"
"*Self-publishes books \n"
"*Suffers from insomnia \n"
"*Has a delicate stomach"
msgstr ""
"*Connaît beaucoup de choses \n"
"*Livres auto-publiés \n"
"*Souffre d'insomnie \n"
"*A un estomac sensible"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.willow
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.willow"
msgid ""
"*Has a fondness for fire, but hates the cold \n"
"*Protected by her cuddly bear, Bernie\n"
"*Has a reliable lighter"
msgstr ""
"*A une attirance pour le feu, mais déteste le froid \n"
"*Protégée par son ours en peluche, Bernie\n"
"*Dispose d'un briquet résistant"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson"
msgid ""
"\n"
"*Grows a magnificent beard"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"*Il lui pousse une barbe magnifique"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.winona
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.winona"
msgid ""
"*Is a skilled builder\n"
"*Gets one free hit from the dark\n"
"*Invents her own gadgets"
msgstr ""
"*Bâtisseuse de talent\n"
"*Résiste au premier coup de l'obscurité\n"
"*Invente ses propres gadgets"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang"
msgid ""
"*Works hard to grow mighty \n"
"*Becomes wimpy without regular exercise \n"
"*Can carry heavy objects with ease \n"
"*Is afraid of monsters and the dark"
msgstr ""
"*Travaille dur pour devenir puissant\n"
"*Devient faible sans exercice régulier\n"
"*Peut aisément porter des objets lourds\n"
"*A peur des monstres et de l'obscurité "

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wonkey
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wonkey"
msgid "*Whoever they were, they're a monkey now"
msgstr "*Peu importe qui il était, c'est un singe maintenant"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie"
msgid ""
"*Has a lovely axe... \n"
"*And is at war with the forest \n"
"*Suffers from the curse of the Werebeaver! \n"
"*And the Weremoose and the Weregoose... \n"
"*Is thankful for bountiful harvests"
msgstr ""
"*A une belle hache... \n"
"*Et est en guerre avec la forêt \n"
"*Souffre de la malédiction du Castor-Garou ! \n"
"*Et de l'Élan-Garou et de l'Oie-Garou...\n"
"*Se réjouit des récoltes abondantes"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_canada
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_canada"
msgid ""
"*Has a lovely axe... \n"
"*And is at war with the forest \n"
"*Suffers from the curse of the Werebeaver! \n"
"*And the Weremoose and the Weregoose... \n"
"*Celebrates Thanksgiving at the correct time"
msgstr ""
"*A une belle hache... \n"
"*Et est en guerre avec la forêt \n"
"*Souffre de la malédiction du Castor-Garou ! \n"
"*Et de l'Élan-Garou et de l'Oie-Garou...\n"
"*Célèbre Thanksgiving au bon moment"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_us
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_us"
msgid ""
"*Has a lovely axe... \n"
"*And is at war with the forest \n"
"*Suffers from the curse of the Werebeaver! \n"
"*And the Weremoose and the Weregoose... \n"
"*Celebrates Thanksgiving too early"
msgstr ""
"*A une belle hache... \n"
"*Et est en guerre avec la forêt \n"
"*Souffre de la malédiction du Castor-Garou ! \n"
"*Et de l'Élan-Garou et de l'Oie-Garou...\n"
"*Célèbre Thanksgiving trop tôt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wormwood
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wormwood"
msgid ""
"*Plants relate to him \n"
"*Saddened when plants are killed \n"
"*Has a Green Thumb \n"
"*Food fills his stomach, but not his heart"
msgstr ""
"*Les plantes se fient à lui \n"
"*S'attriste quand des plantes sont tuées\n"
"*A la main verte\n"
"*La nourriture remplit son estomac, mais pas son cœur"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wortox
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wortox"
msgid ""
"*Is an imp \n"
"*Can hop through time and space \n"
"*Less nourished by physical food"
msgstr ""
"*Est un diablotin \n"
"*Peut faire des sauts dans le temps et l'espace \n"
"*Les aliments physiques sont moins nourrissant"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wurt
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wurt"
msgid ""
"*At home in the swamp \n"
"*Has big plans for Merm-kind \n"
"*Is a vegetarian"
msgstr ""
"*Habite dans les marais\n"
"*A de grand projets pour l'espèce des Hommes-Poissons\n"
"*Est végétarienne"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78"
msgid ""
"*Can upgrade with circuits \n"
"*Not a picky eater \n"
"*Is charged by lightning, but damaged by water"
msgstr ""
"*Peut être amélioré avec des circuits\n"
"*Pas un mangeur difficile\n"
"*Chargé par la foudre, mais endommagé par l'eau  "

